    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-4" style="color: var(--text-primary);">SSC CGL 2026 Photo & Signature Upload — Complete Size Guide</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">

      <p>SSC CGL 2026 requires two separate identity checks during registration: a live photo captured through the portal, and a scanned photo and signature you upload from a file. Getting the scanned upload wrong — wrong dimensions, wrong file size, or a signature in block letters — is one of the most common reasons candidates get stuck at the registration step. This guide covers the exact specs and how to meet them.</p>

      <div class="toc">
        <p>On this page</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#live-vs-scan">Live Capture vs. Scanned Upload</a></li>
